[02:30.025]I'll walk in step beside you
[02:33.891]我会与你相伴前行
[02:33.891]Now, stay true
[02:36.110]请保持那份真挚
[02:36.110]Thaw winter's rime anew
[02:39.222]让冬日的霜华消融
[02:39.222]Woven memories your boon
[02:44.981]记忆编织成祝福
[02:44.981]And like a melody, sing our reverie
[02:52.054]像一段旋律，哼唱我们的涟漪
